  "label": "Anti-Bank Stereotype",
  "description": "The meme relies on the stereotype that banks are greedy, exploitative, and corrupt institutions that profit from the suffering of the working class. This stereotype is used to justify the hatred expressed in the text 'fuck banks'. The meme implicitly references the historical and contemporary context of financial institutions as symbols of systemic exploitation and greed, which are often criticized in popular culture and political discourse.",
